 "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiMain", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I guess the onsen here? What, you want "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to take a bath?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 111, "parameters": [1, 142, 0, 0, 0]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 122, "parameters": [142, 142, 0, 0, 1]}, {"indent": 2, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 412, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [3, "Does \"Water\" mean anything to you?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiMain", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Sister? Everyone here is my Onee-san, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["is that what you mean?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 0, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 404, "parameters": []}, {"indent": 0, "code": 102, "parameters": [["Use the Fox Fire", "Show her Suzume's List", "Enter the Onsen", "Nevermind"], 0]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 402, "parameters": [0, ["Use the Fox Fire", "Show her Suzume's List", "Enter the Onsen", "Nevermind"]]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["SamuraiMain", 2, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Arigato! But what is it?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 212, "parameters": [0, 143, false]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [5]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 205, "parameters": [0, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": true, "list": [{"code": 41, "parameters": ["Miko Inari Set", 4]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 41, "parameters": ["Miko Inari Set", 4]}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 230, "parameters": [5]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 213, "parameters": [0, 1, true]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Foxy 251", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["N-nani? Is this fur? Wow! Look Onii-san, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I'm a fox! Did you do this? Sugoi!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I wonder if I can-\\.nghh..."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I feel really...um...\\.hey, you're a lot "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["more kawaii than I thought...\\.I think "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I need to...\\.um."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 231, "parameters": [1, "Foxy 40", 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 255, 0]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Other Player End Faces 4", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Can we um...do you want to...\\.nghh, "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["please fuck me! Gomen'nasai!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Time to pull my weight in this "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["dynamic duo!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["What?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 0, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Hey, we caused this. It would be rude "]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["to just leave her like this!"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Right...just make it quick alright?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["We're here for Fera, remember?"]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Dominic Faceset 2", 3, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Quick in and out, got it."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 401, "parameters": ["..."]}, {"indent": 1, "code": 221, "parameters": []}, {"